The values of $x_{(\delta_2,\delta_3,\delta_4)}$, $x_{(\delta_3,\delta_4)}$, and $x_{(\delta_4)}$ corresponding to the classes in $\C_i(B)$ for $1 \leq i \leq 3$ are given in Table \ref{tab:s=4}.

