codex
Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on Lemma 4.1 and Construction 4.3 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.11655).

Key results:

- Exact sparse-polynomial witness; no graph surrogate.
- All local G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000.
